==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 2~2.67 seconds<sup>60f~80f</sup>.
*1 [[Doctor K.O.]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Deathkory]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 2~2.67 seconds<sup>60f~80f</sup>.
**10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~2.67 seconds<sup>60f~80f</sup>.
**10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 2~2.67 seconds<sup>60f~80f</sup>.
**10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 2~2.67 seconds<sup>60f~80f</sup>.
**10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 2~2.67 seconds<sup>60f~80f</sup>.
**10 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Raynard]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is really simple, yet another basic encounter with Deathkory. Very similiar to [[Titanic Steakhouse]].

Upon base hit, lure Doctor K.O. to the [[Cat Base]] and finish them the way you would do with luring Titanic Steakhouse's [[Othom]] alone, then start deploying some meatshields, [[Cat Researcher]], [[Can Can Cat]], [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] and [[Fallen Bear Cat]].

